{"title":"1997 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/3/0939e46c6fb0d165987c1edfa050a09d11501a6d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4 + 35}{8 - 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"55\" height=\"40\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/f/c0f4169fdb139db01aca558f296a9e578eaf442a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ \\frac{11}{7} \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 8 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ \\frac{7}{2} \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ -12 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"445\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can simply add the numbers in the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Numerator\" title=\"Numerator\">numerator</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Denominator\" title=\"Denominator\">denominator</a> of the fraction, and then simplify the fraction:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/0/340adbfe94af438538998e7dec2a8e30963d433d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{4 + 35}{8 - 5} = \\frac{39}{3} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(E) } 13}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"189\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"1997 CEMC Pascal\">1997 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1997 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1997 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1997 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1997 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1997 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1997 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1997 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1997 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1997_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Probl